;; Task registry for `kbb --backend sci scripts/run-task.cljk <task> [args…]` (ADR-2607173000).
;;
;; This file was a literal empty registry from the Wave-3 conversion until
;; 2026-08-13. bb.edn defined one task, `kisekae`, as
;; (load-file "test/kisekae_test.cljk") — a babashka-hosted body the converter
;; classified as :complex and did not carry over, so the contract gate this
;; repo's README documented had no runnable entrypoint for four weeks
;; (ADR-2608131600, ADR-2608133200). The recovered form is kept in
;; scripts/tasks-complex.edn.
;;
;; The port is direct: test/kisekae_test.cljk is a plain top-to-bottom script, so
;; JVM Clojure runs it as a script argument the same way babashka did. Measured
;; 2026-08-13: "Kisekae gate: 47/47 passed".
{:kisekae {:cmd ["kbb" "-M" "test/kisekae_test.cljk"]
           :doc "Contract gate for character-spec / edit / build / store (ADR-2607071610). 47 checks; non-zero exit on failure."}
 :lint    {:cmd ["kbb" "-M:lint"]
           :doc "clj-kondo across src + test."}}
